Package: libpango-1.0-0
Version: @DEB_LIBPANGO_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.pango.org/
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libcairo2, libharfbuzz0b, libfribidi0, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6
Description: Layout and rendering of internationalized text
 Pango is a library for laying out and rendering of text, with an emphasis on
 internationalization. It can be used anywhere that text layout is needed,
 though most of the work on Pango so far has been done in the context of the
 GTK widget toolkit.
 .
 This package contains the shared libraries.
